  "description": {
   "en": "The main character, Aio, still has memories of his lover from a previous life, and he hopes to be reunited with her again. One day, Aio learns that the memory of his lover from his previous life has been restored by the power of God, and he begins to search for her in order to be reunited with her. However, a number of people claim that their memories of their previous lives have been restored...? The 41st Square Enix Manga Award Honorable Mention Winner!",
   "es-la": "El protagonista, Aio, que aún conserva recuerdos de una amante de una vida anterior, espera reunirse con ella. Un día, Aio recibe la noticia de que los recuerdos de su amante de una vida anterior han sido restaurados por el poder de Dios, y comienza a buscarla para reunirse con ella. Sin embargo, varias personas afirman que sus recuerdos de su vida anterior han sido restaurados...? ¡Ganador del 41º Premio Manga Square Enix!"
  },
